/T45n1854_p0113c01","n":"0113c","t":"別人中師子雖有去來常住無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1854_p0114a01","n":"0114a","t":"不實一切實者亦為無為一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1854_p0114b01","n":"0114b","t":"辨何者第一約涅槃大品二經"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1854_p0114c01","n":"0114c","t":"背耶以此而椎故知有為世諦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1854_p0115a01","n":"0115a","t":"及與不空智者既了生死空不"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T45n1854-二諦義","source":"CBETA T45n1854 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":113,"unit":"T45 頁欄"}